  "metadata": {
    "id": "jcgm102-9.5.3-ten-temperatures",
    "title": {
      "en": "Ten Celsius temperatures with one resistance thermometer, implicit model (JCGM 102 9.5.3)",
      "tr": "Tek direnç termometresiyle on Celsius sıcaklığı, örtük model (JCGM 102 9.5.3)"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "JCGM 102:2011 9.5.3: ten temperatures measured with the same calibrated thermometer are correlated through its calibration constants (Tables 15 and 16).",
      "tr": "JCGM 102:2011 9.5.3: aynı kalibre termometreyle ölçülen on sıcaklık, kalibrasyon sabitleri üzerinden koreledir (Tablo 15 ve 16)."
    },
    "explanation": [
      {
        "en": "Implicit model h(θ, X) = R₀(1 + Aθ + Bθ²) − r R_S = 0 (31): the thermometer resistance R(θ) compared with a standard resistor R_S by a bridge measuring r = R(θ)/R_S.",
        "tr": "Örtük model h(θ, X) = R₀(1 + Aθ + Bθ²) − r R_S = 0 (31): termometre direnci R(θ), r = R(θ)/R_S oranını ölçen bir köprüyle standart direnç R_S ile karşılaştırılır."
      },
      {
        "en": "The calibration constants R₀, A and B are correlated (Table 13); θ is found by Newton's method and u(θ) from C_y U_y C_yᵀ = C_x U_x C_xᵀ with C_y = (A + 2Bθ)R₀ (6.3.1.3, 9.5.2.6).",
        "tr": "Kalibrasyon sabitleri R₀, A ve B koreledir (Tablo 13); θ Newton yöntemiyle, u(θ) ise C_y = (A + 2Bθ)R₀ ile C_y U_y C_yᵀ = C_x U_x C_xᵀ bağıntısından bulunur (6.3.1.3, 9.5.2.6)."
      },
      {
        "en": "The ten equations (32) share R₀, A, B and R_S; C_y is diagonal and C_x = [C_x⁽¹⁾ C_x⁽²⁾] (9.5.3.5). The uncertainty is smallest near 0 °C and grows above 25 °C, outside the calibration points (9.5.3.6).",
        "tr": "On denklem (32) R₀, A, B ve R_S'yi paylaşır; C_y köşegendir ve C_x = [C_x⁽¹⁾ C_x⁽²⁾] (9.5.3.5). Belirsizlik 0 °C yakınında en küçüktür ve kalibrasyon noktalarının dışında, 25 °C'nin üzerinde artar (9.5.3.6)."
      }
    ],
    "field": "temperature",
    "sources": [
      {
        "document": "JCGM 102:2011, Evaluation of measurement data — Supplement 2 to the “Guide to the expression of uncertainty in measurement” — Extension to any number of output quantities",
        "section": "9.5.3 (Tables 14–16)",
        "url": "https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/2071204/JCGM_102_2011_E.pdf"
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "jcgm102",
      "multivariate",
      "implicit-model",
      "resistance-thermometer",
      "correlated-outputs"
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "en": "Table 15 labels the seventh column θ6 instead of θ7.",
        "tr": "Tablo 15 yedinci sütunu θ7 yerine θ6 olarak adlandırır."
      }
    ]
  },
